Package: worldhdi
Type: Package
Title: Human Development Index Worldwide 1990-2022 (2024)
Version: 1.0.2
Description: Provides Human Development Index (HDI) trends from 1990 to 2022 for 195 countries and territories (193 of them ranked) and 15 UNDP aggregates (development groups, regions and the world), from the UNDP Human Development Report 2023/2024 Statistical Annex. It includes HDI ranks, changes in rank and average annual HDI growth.
